# Session state snapshots (written by context-discipline).
# The ** prefix matters: a pattern with an inner slash is anchored to this
# file's directory, so a bare `.claude/state/` would miss the copies that
# testing leaves under plugins/.
**/.claude/state/
**/.claude/handoff.md
